Pipeline Execution Flow 

User selects a branch before the build starts.

Checkout stage

Invalid branches → build is aborted immediately.

Valid branch → Git checkout occurs.

Parallel Tests

Unit tests and Integration tests run at the same time.

If any test fails → pipeline stops.

Approval Gate

Pipeline pauses and waits for manual confirmation.

Deploy Stage

Deployment runs with a 5-minute timeout.

If deployment exceeds time → Jenkins kills it.

Build is marked FAILED.
